+### IMPORT-079 — Applicant note labels
+
+- **Type:** conversion
+- **Trigger:** A paragraph, including a paragraph in a table cell, starts with `Note` or `Please note` followed by a colon or dash, or with `N.B.` followed by whitespace, a colon or dash, or the end of the paragraph. Matching is case-insensitive and can span inline formatting runs.
+- **Action:** Replace only the leading label with bold `Note:`. Preserve the following text and its inline formatting. Ordinary sentences and labels later in the paragraph remain as written.
+- **Source:** `content_processing.py::normalize_applicant_note_labels`
+- **Status:** active on import and reimport
+
